  getting to those schools and that's why  I'm announcing today that we're your  children persistently truant and you're  fined as is the current system if those  fines aren't paid they should come out  of your child benefit because as parents  we've all got a duty to get our children  into school because if they don't go to  school they'll get worse results their  have worst job prospects that wrecked  their life chances and that's not the  sort of society we should be building  very fair point and to use your own  phrase that links to another job which  is your own job and there now you stride  out of your home that's a great link yes  I'm learning from the master here and  basically I saw you striding out of your  hotel today you head off to conference  there you're a man who's got an appetite  for this job you have things to do you  you you've got a lot of unfinished  business and as well which leads me to  the point you've got them all you know  in this beauty contest of Jeremy Hunt  and Niki Morgan and Boris Johnson and  razor May are you gonna break their  hearts in a few years time because maybe  you know when you definitely finally  utterly are you going to call it a day  or could you be tempted no I I won't be  tempted look I'm as far as I can see it  I am half way through this job I've got  an immense passion for it I leap out of  bed every day feeling what an honor it  is to serve this great country of ours  but there's so much for us to do we've  got a stronger economy  let's finish that work let's add to that  a more secure country and let's add to  that a country where we build genuine  social mobility so people can go from  the bottom to the very top I've got a  huge passion for this job  I've also got a talented team behind me  and after I've done the the two terms  the ten years I'm sure there'll be many  talented people who put their their name  forward and I'm frankly I'm proud of  them proud of the fact that you know  they're increasingly being 